stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Scheduled: publish with future open date
  Draft --> Open: publish now
  Scheduled --> Open: open date reached
  Open --> Closed: due date reached
  Open --> Draft: unpublish (no submissions yet)
  Closed --> Grading: teacher starts grading
  Grading --> ResultsReleased: release results
  ResultsReleased --> Archived: academic year ends
  Archived --> [*]
